      "title": "The button that holds the car still",
      "role": "intro",
      "topic": "powertrain",
      "outcome": "",
      "usp_ids": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "CRETA's auto hold can hold a stationary car without keeping the brake pressed, standard from King. The gearbox is a different part of the driving decision to consider.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_e1266b7974b364c1c1ba",
            "focus": "Stationary brake holding"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F015",
            "F016"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "opening-L1",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 14.7,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "For King, King Knight and Lounge, auto hold is standard. The equipment table also lists it for automatic versions of S(O), S(O) Knight and SX Premium; E, EX, EX(O) and SX do not have it.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_e1266b7974b364c1c1ba",
            "focus": "Auto hold trim scope"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F015",
            "F016"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "opening-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Auto hold keeps the stationary vehicle in place without continued pressure on the brake pedal. That is the supplied function; its description does not guarantee holding on every possible surface.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_e1266b7974b364c1c1ba",
            "focus": "Brake holding function"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F015"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "opening-D2"
        }
      ],
      "stop_id": null,
