    {
      "id": "anchors",
      "title": "Your gearbox, rear seats and airbags",
      "role": "outcome",
      "topic": "highlights",
      "outcome": "Choose which buying detail to explore",
      "usp_ids": [
        "choose-your-gears",
        "flexible-rear-room",
        "airbags-from-the-start"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Your choice of manual or automatic, room that changes with your plans, and airbags even on the starting trim belong together. Interrupt freely; gearboxes follow engine and trim, with King's turbo automatic-only.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F005",
            "F006",
            "F008",
            "F009",
            "F022",
            "F023",
            "F025"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "anchors-L1",
          "start": 14.7,
          "duration": 16.8,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "The gearbox decision depends on the engine as well as the trim: non-turbo petrol and diesel each offer manual or automatic combinations. The turbo petrol is different, using an automatic only and appearing only on King.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_3aa2ebf1c9ed94570455",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F005",
            "F006",
            "F008",
            "F009"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "anchors-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Standard split rear seats give a way to divide passenger and luggage space, and the standard six airbags include driver, passenger, side and curtain airbags. Both equipment listings apply even to E; neither gives a personal-fit result or crash rating.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_adb415f161dfc9567dde",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F022",
            "F023",
            "F025"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "anchors-D2"
        }
      ],
      "stop_id": null,
      "fundamental": false,
