    {
      "id": "driving-choices-3",
      "title": "The petrol, diesel and turbo choices (cont.)",
      "role": "proof",
      "topic": "powertrain",
      "outcome": "Choose an engine and gearbox pairing",
      "usp_ids": [
        "choose-your-gears"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Pick turbo petrol and the gearbox is automatic only, with that engine listed solely on King; King has other engines too. The chosen trim also belongs beside the wheel-and-tyre discussion.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": "Turbo petrol pairing"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F005",
            "F006"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "driving-choices-L3",
          "start": 63.1,
          "duration": 15.8,
          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "The one-point-five-litre turbo petrol produces a stated maximum 117.5 kilowatts, or 160 PS, at 5,500 revolutions per minute. It uses a seven-speed dual-clutch automatic; these are source specifications without an acceleration-time measurement.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": "Turbo engine specification"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F004",
            "F005"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "driving-choices-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "For the one-point-five-litre diesel, torque is 250 newton metres at 1,500–2,750 revolutions per minute, with six-speed manual or automatic options. Non-turbo petrol offers a six-speed manual or IVT automatic; the complete trim pairings need the applicable engine matrix.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_87bac17ee980151549ba",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F003",
            "F007",
            "F008",
            "F009"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "driving-choices-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Normal, Eco, Sport, Snow, Mud and Sand modes and paddle shifters are automatic-only on S(O), S(O) Knight, SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge. No current S(O) Knight automatic combination is shown in the engine matrix.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_893405c770ce75e06502",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F013",
            "F014"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "driving-choices-D3"
        }
      ],
      "stop_id": "powertrain",
      "fundamental": true,
      "word_budget": 30,
