            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F017"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "wheels-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "King has R18 diamond-cut alloys, while S(O) Knight, King Knight and Lounge Edition have R18 matte-black alloys. The photograph shows a wheel and caliper, but cannot establish the rim size by measurement.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
            "ref": "im_pdf_a4463ebb4d4d6329f98a",
            "focus": "Alloy wheel detail"
          },
          "fact_ids": [
            "F017"
          ],
          "card": "none",
          "delivery": {
            "tone": "warm",
            "pace": 1.0
          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "wheels-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "The tyre figures are 205/65 R16 for the entry specification, 215/60 R17 for S(O), SX and SX Premium, and 215/55 R18 for S(O) Knight, King and King Knight. No comparative rough-road comfort follows from those sizes.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "ref": "im_pdf_a4463ebb4d4d6329f98a",
            "focus": ""
          },
          "fact_ids": [
