          "id": "rear-space-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "S(O), S(O) Knight, SX, SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge have the two-step rear seatback adjustment. Rear-window sunshades cover those versions plus EX(O), so recline and shades do not have identical availability.",
          "step": "say",
