      "outcome": "Distinguish standard equipment and selected assistance",
      "usp_ids": [
        "airbags-from-the-start"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "With traffic ahead, forward-collision warning and assistance is fitted to King, King Knight and Lounge Edition. Safe, attentive driving remains essential; a passenger's temperature preferences bring a different consideration into the cabin.",
