          "exact": false
        }
      ],
      "checkin": "",
      "deeper": [
        {
          "text": "Standard equipment includes stability control, disc brakes at the front and rear, hill-start assistance, tyre-pressure monitoring and rear parking sensors. Hyundai says hill-start assistance prevents backward rolling on slopes; that statement does not remove driver responsibility.",
