          "unverified": false,
          "id": "occupants-and-assistance-D1"
        },
        {
          "text": "The camera displays show parking and side views. Surround and blind-spot view monitors are fitted to SX Premium, King, King Knight and Lounge; the pictures show the views themselves rather than a recorded parking manoeuvre.",
          "step": "say",
          "visual": {
            "kind": "image",
