          },
          "unverified": false,
          "id": "occupants-and-assistance-D2"
        },
        {
          "text": "King, King Knight and Lounge have blind-spot warning, avoidance and lane assistance, and their automatics have Smart Cruise Control with Stop and Go. Attentive, safe driving remains essential; SX Premium cameras do not extend that cruise availability to SX Premium.",
          "step": "say",
